00:57:25.920 --> 00:57:33.280
<v Jewel Tarver>Through these woods, across an old hickory log, across a creek.
<v Jewel Tarver>穿过这些树林，跨过一根古老的山核桃原木，穿过一条小溪。

00:57:33.280 --> 00:57:37.350
